{"id":"53c6f94a73ab3e2c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FSentence.md","title":"FSentence","display":"FSentence","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FSentence","parameters":["E","F","R","f","r","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FSentence"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：一阶语法与替换。有序参数：<code>E</code>、<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FSentence E F R f r a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and (@ FFm E F R f r a) (forall x (not (@ FFree E F R f r x a))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7d109a270c3f3d46\" href=\"?note=7d109a270c3f3d46\" title=\"ZFC_FFm\">FFm</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"be21a8fefe07593d\" href=\"?note=be21a8fefe07593d\" title=\"ZFC_FFree\">FFree</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FSentence E F R f r a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FFm","status":"resolved","id":"7d109a270c3f3d46","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FFm|FFm]]；[[ZFC_FFree|FFree]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FFree","status":"resolved","id":"be21a8fefe07593d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FFm|FFm]]；[[ZFC_FFree|FFree]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":834,"backlinks":[{"id":"b7e69cae674ee491","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FSentence|FSentence]]"},{"id":"1c367ee40265c411","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_ArSig|ArSig]]；[[ZFC_FAssign|FAssign]]；[[ZFC_FSat|FSat]]；[[ZFC_FSentence|FSentence]]；[[ZFC_NatStructure|NatStructure]]"},{"id":"a8b1332dd97b2603","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_FSentence|FSentence]]；[[ZFC_FWrapped|FWrapped]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-398","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_FSentence|FSentence]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","7d109a270c3f3d46","be21a8fefe07593d","593f9bdab4d60707"]}